  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.15.0: Loam.Pickers DateRangePicker editable text entry — set Editable to type a \"start – end\" range (also \" to \"/\" - \"; a single date sets only Start); committed on Enter/blur, each half parsed via DatePicker.TryParseDate, auto-ordered, validated against MinDate/MaxDate (InvalidRangeText on failure). Calendar icon becomes a button (Alt+Down also opens), flyout stays in sync. Public static TryParseRange exposes the rule. Completes editable across all three field pickers. Additive, off by default. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
